You may create Modified Versions for personal, internal, educational,
experimental, or other use permitted by this License.

If You are eligible for free Commercial Use under Section 4 or Section 5, You
may also use Your own Modified Version internally for that Commercial Use.

You may publicly distribute a Modified Version only on a **Noncommercial** basis.

For the avoidance of doubt, the EUR 25,000 Revenue Threshold does not create a
right to commercially distribute, sell, license for a fee, bundle for commercial
distribution, or otherwise commercially exploit a Modified Version.

Commercial Distribution of a Modified Version requires a separate license from
the Licensor.

Every permitted Distribution of a Modified Version must:

1. remain subject to this EWP Waveform Community License 1.0;
2. include a complete copy of this License;
