## 12. No Artificial Separation to Avoid the Revenue Threshold

You may not avoid the Revenue Threshold by assigning use of the Software to a
shell, affiliate, controlled entity, special-purpose entity, or other related
Entity whose separate treatment would not reflect the economic reality of the
relationship.

Revenue of Entities that control, are controlled by, or are under common control
with one another must be combined when determining eligibility.

